Step 1: Start the program.
Step 2: Set head = NULL.
Step 3: Display the menu:
•Add Patient
•Display Patients
•Search Patient
•Exit
Step 4: Read the user’s choice.
Step 5: If choice is 1, create a new patient node, enter ID and name, and add it to the linked 
list.
Step 6: If choice is 2, traverse the linked list and display all patient records.
Step 7: If choice is 3, enter the patient ID and search the linked list.
If ID is found → display patient name.
Otherwise → display “Patient not found.”
Step 8: If choice is 4, exit the program.
Step 9: Repeat the menu until the user selects Exit.
Step 10: Stop.

